:name: DD-018 TCB-link execution boot (RT1176 Cortex-M7)
:description: Boots the fused wasm(compute)+native(tcb_seed) image and lets it run;
:description: the reset shim stores compute()=tcb_seed()+1 to DTCM @0x20010000.

using sysbus
mach create "tcb"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @hardware/renode/pixhawk6xrt.repl
sysbus LoadELF @hardware/renode/tcb-link/tcb-link.elf

# Run briefly: _reset sets SP, calls compute (the synth --relocatable wasm export),
# stores the result to DTCM, then idle-spins at `b .`. 0.5ms is ample for a few insns.
emulation RunFor "0.0005"
pause

echo "TCB_EXEC_WORD_BEGIN"
sysbus ReadDoubleWord 0x20010000
echo "TCB_EXEC_WORD_END"
